      "type_message": 0,
      "texts": [
        {
          "text": "The sky over the Zone hung like a felt blanket, fine raindrops sifting down from it like dust. Somewhere beyond the Perimeter, the December wind was raging, but here, on this land fenced off from the world by barbed wire, it was eternal autumn. And still, the day had turned out unusually rough.",
          "condition": {}
