      "type_stage": 0,
      "background": "story/prologue/screen/chapter_0_2.jpg",
      "title": "Rookie Village, Cordon",
      "message": "Sidorovich: Swing by the receiving checkpoint before the Garbage — there's barely any guards, but new faces have started showing up: veterans, masters. Might build up some trust, or pick up some useful experience.",
      "type_message": 1,
      "texts": [
        {
          "text": "Lightning flashed in the west. Barking, the dogs circled the area but didn't dare come near the man. The Communist sighed and lazily lobbed another rusty bolt ahead of him. Where it landed, the air, which had been rippling uneasily, erupted in an electro-discharge.",
          "condition": {}
        }
      ],
      "transfers": [
