      "background": "story/prologue/screen/chapter_0_7.jpg",
      "title": "Arkady the Jew",
      "message": "",
      "type_message": 0,
      "texts": [
        {
          "text": "It all just got old! Everything always goes to hell! I finished military medic school in that damn Hradec Kralove! I wanted to get posted to some hot zone! I could've made Captain! But they just turned me down at the last minute!",
          "condition": {}
        }
      ],
      "transfers": [
        {
          "text": "Well, there's always something happening around here: plenty of places to put your skills to use. Shoot a bit, patch someone up, even play some guitar to set the mood. So why were you so eager to go there, you fool?",
          "stage": 18,
          "condition": {}
        }
      ],
      "actions": {},
      "editor": {
        "x": 1207.3013366217772,
        "y": 730.984975973753
